From: DevomB <Devom.hb@yahoo.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Draw at the output's scale

havoc draws at one size, so at a scale of 2, or of 1.5, the compositor
enlarges its buffer and every terminal is soft. It binds wp_viewporter and
wp_fractional_scale_v1 where the compositor offers them, and at the scale
the window is told draws its font that much larger into a buffer the
window's size times the scale, which the viewport shows at the window's
size: each pixel is one of the screen's. What the cells leave is margin,
and pointer positions are scaled to the cells. At a scale of 1, or without
the two globals, it draws as before.
